{
 "_doc": "Tier-2 pool building (random towns, industrial lots): a quarry's scale house, office and equipment shed with a steel-lined powder magazine. Route: the office door is bolted -> round the back: a haul truck backed through the equipment shed wall -> the shed (jaws by the drill rack) -> the scale house: the weighmaster still at the terminal -> the manager's office: the magazine key in the desk (taking it wakes the core shed: ambush) -> back through the shed to the magazine door (cans on it in one dressing) -> the magazine: the blaster guards it -> through the office, unbolting the front door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
